<p>The system must support time-sensitive and enforcement-based messaging t=
o guide customer actions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>BR=E2=80=9108</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>The system must enforce business rules related to case prioritisation an=
d visibility within the customer journey</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenc=
eTable">
